  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Love the idea of support directly through VRChat, and not something like Patreon where they take a cut of the profit..\nI've got a few ideas thatd make it more interesting to buy, and make it not purely cosmetic, such as:\n* More avatar customization, such as an animated logo or gold border\n* Featured VRC+ tab in the world and avatar menu, essentially giving the ability to reach a larger audience with your status\n* Ability to create VRC+ only public worlds? Don't have to worry about users that are toxic/incompetent and just want to ruin the experience of a public world. Meet people who actually care about VRChat and reach larger creators/supporters easier.\n* Ability to change username more often? Maybe 50 days instead of 90? Or a way to have a nickname system, that highlights the name a color so that things like impersonation aren't an issue.\n* Ability to gift VRC+ to other users? Either by username or email confirmation\nThese are a few that I could think of off the top of my head.. I feel like VRC+ is a great way to support the team directly and I'm personally all for it. At the moment its really bare bones so everyone needs to calm down about it. More will be added and the experience will be more worthwhile with enough time. We've just gotta give our input if we want to see it work\nHave a great day! ^u^",
